362: ## SM.7. Exact source coordinates at the remaining zero puncture
363: 
364: Working source-chart calculation only; no completed-family return is assigned.
365: Put \(v=u^3\) and use the literal global coordinate change
366: \[
367:  X=u^2x,\qquad Y=u^3y,\qquad T=u^4t.
368: \]
369: It transforms the marked source into
370: \[
371:  Y^2=X^3+(1-2v)X^2+TX+v^2,\qquad G=(0,v),
372:  \qquad T_0=v^2-2v.
373: \]
374: These coordinates descend under the exact marked \(\mu_3\) maps of SM.1:
375: all three of \(X,Y,T\) are unchanged. The selected cubic is exactly
376: \[
377:  P(X,T_0)=(X-v)^2(X+1).
378: \]
379: Its discriminant is
380: \[
381:  (-T+v^2-2v)(4T^2-4Tv-T+32v^3-11v^2+2v).
382: \]
383: At \(v=0\), it is \(T^2(1-4T)\). The displayed minimal source then has
384: \(III^*,I_2,I_1\) fibres and \(G=(0,0)\) is the nonzero two-torsion
385: section on every smooth fibre. These facts do not assert that the original
386: line lift or logarithmic cap extends as the same completed threefold there.
387: 
388: There is an exact marked nodal-group computation on the selected fibre.
389: Write \(s=Y/(X-v)\), so \(X=s^2-1\), and choose
390: \(c=\sqrt{1+v}\) near one. With zero section at \(s=\infty\), the
391: multiplicative coordinate \(Z=(s-c)/(s+c)\) has \(Z(O)=1\).
392: Since \(s(G)=-1\),
393: \[
394:  Z(G)=\frac{1+c}{1-c},\qquad v Z(G)\longrightarrow -4.
395: \]
396: Thus the actual selected nodal Picard point winds once negatively around
397: \(v=0\), in this fixed branch marking. The marked Tate parameter for
398: \(q=T-T_0\) has
399: \[
400:  q_T=-\frac{v}{64(1+v)^3}q+O(q^2).
401: \]
402: On a sufficiently small collar relative to the separation of the two nodes,
403: its base-unit factor winds once positively. The marked Weierstrass scaling
404: has the unit square root \(2\sqrt{1+v}\), so no branch inversion occurs
405: in this source chart. The Picard winding and the base-unit winding must both
406: be retained in a later actual cap and toric-line comparison; neither is a
407: computed total-space return. The six exact algebraic identities are executed
408: in `code/part3/source_moduli_boundary_zero.py` and its saved outputs.
